.Dd March 12, 2026
.Dt PCI_ECAM 9
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm pci_ecam_map
.Nd map PCIe ECAM configuration space for a device function
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In kern/pci.h
.Ft void *
.Fn pci_ecam_map "uint16_t segment" "uint8_t bus" "uint8_t slot" "uint8_t func"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn pci_ecam_map
function returns a pointer to the base of the extended configuration
space window for the selected PCIe function when an ECAM aperture has
been configured.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
The function returns a configuration-space pointer on success and
.Dv NULL
if no matching ECAM window exists.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr pci_config 9
